    "updated_at": "2022-08-09T09:07:08Z",
    "body": "Regarding the question of which issues in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4184#issuecomment-1072536425 should be considered blocking for writing up a spec of https://github.com/whatwg/html/wiki/dialog--initial-focus,-a-proposal#initial-dialog-focus-logic : \"sequentially focusable\" is the correct spec term here. This issue should be unblocked.\r\n\r\nI don't believe the introduction of focusgroup (in whatever form it ends up) will change how appropriate the term sequentially focusable is, but maybe I'm missing something.",
