    "created_at": "2022-08-10T00:45:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-10T00:45:18Z",
    "body": "I don't really see the confusion? They're still focusable in sequence, so the term \"sequentially focusable\" seems fine. Perhaps you could give an example of the code you think will be confusing?\r\n\r\nAlso, this is all very speculative, focusgroup is a proposal which hasn't been sent to the WHATWG yet, and I anticipate we can have the discussion of what to call focusgroup's terms when it is?",
